# @see docs/audits/ai-slop-audit.md F-009
id: SLOP-119
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: AI-style promotional file header comment
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .cpp .c .h .hpp .ts .js .py .java .go .rs
  exclude_paths: vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/
patterns:
  - regex: "\\*\\s*(Key (performance|design) features|Performance characteristics|Design highlights):"
    message: "Promotional header comment — describe purpose briefly, not features"
  - regex: "//\\s*This (module|file|component) (provides|implements|offers) a (complete|comprehensive|full|robust)"
    message: "AI-style promotional header — be concise about what the code does"
  - regex: "\\*\\s*(Zero|No) (external )?(dependencies|allocations|overhead)"
    message: "Promotional claim in comment — if true, it's obvious from the code"
fix: "Keep file headers to 1-2 lines: what it does and why it exists. Remove feature lists and performance claims."
